{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2111180787802370048"]},"author_id":"11348282","created_at":"2026-10-16T19:42:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111180963661435219"],"id":"2111180963661435219","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":104794,"like_count":328,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":42,"retweet_count":45},"text":"The aircraft lineup just keeps getting bigger. ✈️\n\nMAX POWER, a new aerospace expo, is set for Nov. 7-8 @NASAKennedy — featuring flyovers and static displays, including NASA’s F-15, F-18, T-38, and ER-2 aircraft.\n\nDetails on how to join us: https://t.co/SPHni2YCxO https://t.co/pXYGxy6ZbE","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2111180963661435219"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T18:40:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111165516312428987"],"id":"2111165516312428987","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3739,"like_count":10,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111164624024535307","type":"quoted"}],"text":"in 1477!!!!! https://t.co/rPls2RiuXz","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111165516312428987"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T18:03:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111155973377139159"],"id":"2111155973377139159","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1938,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111151882089722206","type":"quoted"}],"text":"They always used heavy infantry, but the late Roman period saw a decisive shift to cavalry which never shifted again until gunpowder.\n\nAt Tours, Martel had total strategic surprise, a massive difference in preparation for the field, and then an entire week to dig in. Even then, https://t.co/Sc21agnmEE","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111155973377139159"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T17:38:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111149772203516317"],"id":"2111149772203516317","publ